    "type": "question",
    "label": "4",
    "prompt": "A bowl contains green and red glass balls. The ratio of the number of green balls to the number of red balls is $1:4$. If there are 28 red balls, how many green balls are there?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "7 green balls.",
      "worked": "Four parts represent the 28 red balls.\n$$\\begin{align*}1\\text{ part}&=28\\div4\\\\1\\text{ part}&=7\\text{ balls}\\\\\\text{Number of green balls}&=1\\times7\\\\\\text{Number of green balls}&=7\\end{align*}$$",
